'''Nord Greataxe''' is the fifth, [[Deep North]]-tier two-handed [[axe]].

* Its primary attack is a 3-hit combo (wide swing, wide swing, vertical overhead) with double damage on the last hit, 1.5x [[staggering]] and no multitarget penalty.
* The faster secondary attack deals 0.5x damage and 4x staggering.

It cannot be crafted directly, instead the player must craft the corresponding [[Cast Nord Greataxe]] and harden it in a [[Frost Foundry]]. 

== Mould ==
'''Mould: Nord Greataxe''' can be found:
* By destroying trash piles in [[Winding Tunnels]].
* In chests buried at [[Memorial Site]]s.
* By destroying weapon stands on the last floor of [[Mörkhalla]].

== Upgrade information ==
Like most Deep North-tier weapons, the Nord Greataxe can be upgraded to one of the following two variants using essences:

* {{Item link|Frostfire Greataxe}} (with a [[Frostfire Essence]])
* {{Item link|Thunderblood Greataxe}} (with a [[Thunderblood Essence]])

An upgraded Nord Greataxe will '''NOT''' keep its upgrade level when it is modified using essences.

